# Repo-root .dockerignore — apps' Dockerfiles are built with the repo
# ROOT as context (`docker build -f apps/<app>/Dockerfile .`) so the
# libs/hostkit go.mod replace target resolves inside the context.
# Each Dockerfile COPYs only the dirs it needs (libs/hostkit + its own
# app dir); this list just keeps the context small and reproducible.
.git/
.github/
.moon/
**/bin/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/notes.md
**/changelog.md
**/*.test
**/coverage.out
# Gitignored build outputs that must not leak into the build context
# (a stale apps/node-host-agent/agent is ~47MB). These sit beside the
# **/bin/ dirs already excluded above.
apps/node-host-agent/agent
apps/node-automation-controller/manager
